DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260914
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260921
SUMMARY:Week 1 Focus — Python + MATLAB + PE CH1–CH4
DESCRIPTION:Python foundations; MATLAB basics; Power Electronics CH1–CH4. Goal: code basics, matrices/functions/plots, Buck/Boost/CCM and switching devices.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:week-2-focus@time-planning-office
DTSTAMP:20260912T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260921
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260928
SUMMARY:Week 2 Focus — Undergraduate Power Electronics + Black Library
DESCRIPTION:Finish undergraduate power-electronics core and pair theory with MATLAB/Simulink black-library simulations. Build Buck, Boost, Flyback, rectifier and inverter models.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:week-3-focus@time-planning-office
DTSTAMP:20260912T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260928
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261005
SUMMARY:Week 3 Focus — Simulink + Blue Library
DESCRIPTION:Simulink modelling workflow plus advanced blue-library simulations. Prioritise subsystem, transfer function/state-space, PID, discrete systems, MATLAB Function and PWM grid converter.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:week-4-focus@time-planning-office
DTSTAMP:20260912T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261005
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261012
SUMMARY:Week 4 Focus — Graduate Power Electronics + Integration
DESCRIPTION:Graduate power-electronics overview: resonant converters, LLC, ZCS/ZVS, soft switching; consolidate Python/MATLAB/Simulink and complete one integrated simulation.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
